    },
    {
      "id": "text-1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 50,
      "y": 705,
      "width": 1062.0,
      "height": 131.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 360194350,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1946932524,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1  task chat-agent:external-prereqs: install ingress-nginx and cert-manager (Helm, idempotent)\n2  Read the ingress-nginx LoadBalancer public IP\n3  Create the DNS A record <fqdn> -> that IP at your DNS provider or Azure DNS (operator-managed)\n4  task chat-agent:external-app HOSTNAME=<fqdn>: Entra app registration + Secret harness-oidc-config\n5  task chat-agent:external-up HOSTNAME=<fqdn> LETSENCRYPT_EMAIL=...: ingress + ClusterIssuer, harness to ingress_oidc\n6  Wait until the Certificate is Ready (task chat-agent:external-status)\n7  Open https://<fqdn> in a browser and sign in with Entra",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1  task chat-agent:external-prereqs: install ingress-nginx and cert-manager (Helm, idempotent)\n2  Read the ingress-nginx LoadBalancer public IP\n3  Create the DNS A record <fqdn> -> that IP at your DNS provider or Azure DNS (operator-managed)\n4  task chat-agent:external-app HOSTNAME=<fqdn>: Entra app registration + Secret harness-oidc-config\n5  task chat-agent:external-up HOSTNAME=<fqdn> LETSENCRYPT_EMAIL=...: ingress + ClusterIssuer, harness to ingress_oidc\n6  Wait until the Certificate is Ready (task chat-agent:external-status)\n7  Open https://<fqdn> in a browser and sign in with Entra",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
